# Canvas Components Guide

Reference guide for all Canvas components in the Uniform CMS project.

**Related documentation:**
- React implementation: [uniform-npm-csk-components-page-router.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/uniform-npm-csk-components-page-router.mdc)
- DEX parameters & tokens: [uniform-dex-guide.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/uniform-dex-guide.mdc)

## Overview

- **Location**: `content/component/*.yaml` - YAML definitions for all components
- **Reference**: `node_modules/@uniformdev/csk-components/dist/content/components/canvas/` - CSK component code examples
- **Total**: 47 components across 5 categories

